{"title":"2003 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 20","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Solution_5\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 5</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Part of the graph of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/4/834d0850803426a3c40637713c80b5985a1a205f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x) = ax^3 + bx^2 + cx + d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"207\" height=\"19\" /> is shown. What is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />?\n</p><p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:2003_12B_AMC-20.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/8/8e/2003_12B_AMC-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"147\" height=\"161\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/c/fbc0b505d5b755f2e171d6a7b53ecf9d89ccfede.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)}\\ -4 \\qquad\\mathrm{(B)}\\ -2 \\qquad\\mathrm{(C)}\\ 0 \\qquad\\mathrm{(D)}\\ 2 \\qquad\\mathrm{(E)}\\ 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"387\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Since\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/b/86bdc06d99812833a76429475ddd32d620da7e1d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} -f(-1) = a - b + c - d = 0 = f(1) = a + b + c + d \\end{align*}\" width=\"403\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>It follows that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/9/d89f784f9f2a39b3605ab93f991192119994e3ad.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b + d = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"72\" height=\"14\" />. Also, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/1/31139d7a4d51ea3096d40a646a7f2d59fcc1e49d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d = f(0) = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"100\" height=\"18\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/e/02e283e0930872e09f7f48b4f6b876e5fb674bb9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = -2 \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{(B)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"109\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Two of the roots of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/c/57ccf8d123ba4259e29fba55d9b008874e071492.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x) = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"68\" height=\"18\" /> are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/f/7cfbd35086ffefb83637d42166582b43c8a1ff4a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\pm 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"22\" height=\"12\" />, and we let the third one be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />. Then \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/8/498460502d7b55f1151403b1cda71afbffe6e06d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a(x-1)(x+1)(x-n) = ax^3-anx^2-ax+an = ax^3 + bx^2 + cx + d = 0\\]\" width=\"507\" height=\"19\" />\nNotice that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/a/97a304d413d59296c23d220fd018d6aa8df06abf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(0) = d = an = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"145\" height=\"18\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/f/d8f6f363fe9e6b20e9b4fcda6a39b4275adcbb52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = -an = -2 \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{(B)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"168\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Notice that if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/1/68159ebfcc5bbf2be5b5df2e0a74a9a21a1d73f5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g(x) = 2 - 2x^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"115\" height=\"19\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/5/805f72d665bc73f35318fcd73a8c776e242f8076.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f - g$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"16\" /> vanishes at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/c/3cc55afeea4667e0bd33893f74152cddbc75acff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = -1, 0, 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"91\" height=\"16\" /> and so\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/f/a7f8101b936e4ce7a95605d3d35a94edd409e454.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[f(x) - g(x) = ax(x-1)(x+1) = ax^3 - ax\\]\" width=\"340\" height=\"20\" />\nimplies by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/b/76b2878564ab19b80abb21ba964abe90fe120846.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2$\" width=\"16\" height=\"15\" /> coefficient, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/8/e38e2567712dddf3dc0ab761bc7f797e49be0d63.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b + 2 = 0, b = -2 \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{(B)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"189\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4\">Solution 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>The roots of this equation are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/2/202ae1a8013fde4392b0396515be3dd334d690b1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-1, 1, \\text{ and } x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"96\" height=\"15\" />, letting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> be the root not shown in the graph. By Vieta, we know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/a/7eaa4f69e36dfbc102e7da4aa298514a14e5d3d0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-1+1+x=x=-\\frac{b}{a}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"172\" height=\"37\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/3/69356b96cdc59c0a2563cdff8b0480036eb791ed.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-1\\cdot 1\\cdot x=-x=-\\frac{d}{a}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"168\" height=\"37\" />. Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/e/1cecddc1ed78c8a6a20e6cec73083bc06ba14cef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=\\frac{d}{a}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"46\" height=\"37\" />. Setting the two equations for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> equal to each other, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/3/f0310a4ff366c2d8208bbdbe0bc5e475b99dbb26.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{d}{a}=-\\frac{b}{a}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"64\" height=\"37\" />. We know that the y-intercept of the polynomial is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/8/588e07a0cfc1e617ac5d6552a759b3011aa96d6c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d=2$\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" />. Plugging in for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/09298a15f54bcffa99d15656941da6c79f590587.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2}{a}=-\\frac{b}{a}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"64\" height=\"37\" />.\n</p><p>Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/b/deb0322b5ca7560dc1e4c16eb391e1a887c35dc5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=-2 \\Rightarrow \\boxed{B}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"110\" height=\"24\" />\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_5\">Solution 5</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 5\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>From the graph, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/1/5a1a33e6d802d44c82b87de08fe38ecf73657f14.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(0)=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"67\" height=\"18\" /> so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/8/588e07a0cfc1e617ac5d6552a759b3011aa96d6c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d=2$\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" />. Also from the graph, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/c/e7ca5dc29b26a89e50b36fe9b3df584579666472.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(1)=a+b+c+2=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"192\" height=\"18\" />. But we also have from the graph <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/a/53a82cac352f393a73c261ef1d021b53e514b3ea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(-1)=-a+b-c+2=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"220\" height=\"18\" />. Summing <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/4/a34bee821a0dd72805c9f516e4b3ef3f0a3601cb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(1)+f(2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"92\" height=\"20\" /> we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/2/8c279253881c9b2413ebf1af0ddd4613d16d9c19.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2b+4=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"81\" height=\"14\" /> so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/e/02e283e0930872e09f7f48b4f6b876e5fb674bb9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = -2 \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{(B)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"109\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>Solution by franzliszt\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_12B\" title=\"2003 AMC 12B\">2003 AMC 12B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_12B_Problems\" title=\"2003 AMC 12B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_12B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2003 AMC 12B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"2003 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 19\">Problem 19</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"2003 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 21\">Problem 21</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2003 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2003 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_3\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2003 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_4\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2003 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_5\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2003 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_6\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2003 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2003 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2003 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2003 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2003 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2003 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2003 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2003 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_14\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2003 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_15\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2003 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_16\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2003 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2003 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"2003 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"2003 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"2003 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2003 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"2003 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"2003 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"2003 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 25\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_12_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AMC 12 Problems and Solutions\"> All AMC 12 Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261016234151\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.042 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.074 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 300/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2298/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 158/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 7093/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   12.819      1 -total\n 59.44%    7.619      1 Template:AMC12_box\n 38.83%    4.978      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:6348:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261016234151 and revision id 138271. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}